  acceptedAnswers:
  - The Four Lads
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABWhere's Charley? Medley (with Ray Ellis
    & His Orchestra) - (from the musical \"Where's Charley\")\xBB, de 1938, y llega
    hasta 1989."
  - "\xABThe Mocking Bird\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso cercano a
    109 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABBreezin' Along With The Breeze\xBB y \xABNo
    Not Much\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABMoments To Remember\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABIstanbul (Not Constantinople)\xBB y
    \xABStanding On the Corner\xBB."
